abstract: >-
  An open, versioned county-level table for every U.S. county that sets measures of mental health and substance
  use need among pregnant and postpartum women beside the treatment capacity available to them, with rural and
  frontier counties flagged. Built only from open federal sources.
keywords:
  - perinatal mental health
  - maternal behavioral health
  - substance use treatment
  - county
  - rural health
  - frontier
  - health workforce
  - open data
